{
  "order": 38000,
  "name": "Prepare a write",
  "kind": "function",
  "responsibility": "Makes the candidate a write would land with no lease held, and commits exactly that candidate afterwards",
  "description": "prepareSemanticBoardWrite reads the board as its lease would, applies a stated transition or a historical correction, and admits the candidate by the rules a write itself uses. Its answer carries a commit bound to that candidate: the commit writes the prepared board at the prepared instant under the lease and refuses BOARD_VERSION_CONFLICT when the board has moved since, so the subject ids a caller read evidence about are the ids written. A change to a board that does not exist is refused BOARD_MISSING.",
